[00:00.00] 作曲 : Andrew Wells/Tobias Jesso Jr.
[00:00.00][by:hiuhgi]
[00:25.97]Could it have been we went too far?
[00:25.97] 是否彼时越界太深？
[00:30.43]'Cause there's a void that you left, and it's tearing at my heart
[00:30.43] 你留的心渊至今仍在肋骨作疼
[00:35.01]Do you believe we're at the part
[00:35.01] 你是否相信银幕正演到这一帧？
[00:39.39]After the breakup in a movie where we reignite a spark?
[00:39.39] 老电影里破镜重燃星火余烬的桥段？
[00:44.44]From all that I remember, we'd be better off together
[00:44.44] 记忆经纬织就的图谱中 你我本应契合如榫卯相拥
[00:48.76]Am I mad for thinking that's the only truth?
[00:48.76] 认定这是唯一真理 是否已疯狂？
[00:52.82]I could be wrong, wrong, wrong, well, what do I know?
[00:52.82] 或许是我痴妄 痴妄 痴妄
[00:59.32]What do I know?
[00:59.32] 我又怎知分晓？
