[01:26.19]What do I know?
[01:26.19] 而我又怎知分晓？
[01:28.72]I think that we could find our way
[01:28.72] 我以为我们能找到前途
[01:33.51]'Cause we made it through the winter, aren't we owed some summer days?
[01:33.51] 捱过凛冬长夜 该许我们盛夏光年
[01:37.78]When luck was down, promised I'd stay
[01:37.78] 当厄运啃噬誓言
